|o2 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : A = sub(transpose genericMatrix(coefficientRing R,n,n), R)              |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {0, -1} | a_(1,1) a_(1,2) a_(1,3) |                                     |
|     {0, -1} | a_(2,1) a_(2,2) a_(2,3) |                                     |
|     {0, -1} | a_(3,1) a_(3,2) a_(3,3) |                                     |
|                                                                             |
|             3      3                                                        |
|o3 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                         |
