hadamard -- computes the Hadamard product of two matrices
*********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        hadamard(A, B)
  * Inputs:
      * A, an $m\times n$ matrix
      * B, an $m\times n$ matrix
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the Hadamard product of $A$ and
        $B$

Description
===========

This method computes the Hadamard product of two matrices $A, B$ of the same
size. The Hadamard product is defined as the componentwise product, i.e., if
$A, B$ are $m\times n$ matrices, then the Hadamard product is the $m\times n$
matrix with $(i,j)$ entry equal to $A_{i,j}*B_{i,j}$.



