realPartMatrix -- real part of a matrix over CC
***********************************************

  * Usage: 
        realPartMatrix A
  * Inputs:
      * A, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, with complex entries
  * Outputs:
      * a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the real matrix whose entries
        are real parts of entries of A

Description
===========

Given a complex matrix, this method returns a real matrix obtained by taking
the real part of each entry. It leaves matrices over *note RR:
(Macaulay2Doc)RR, and *note QQ: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ, unchanged.



+--------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : A = random(RR^3,RR^5)                        |
|                                                  |
|o1 = | .892712 .632944  .89189  .775187 .0741835 ||
|     | .673395 .0258884 .231053 .909047 .808694  ||
|     | .29398  .714827  .461944 .314897 .362835  ||
|                                                  |
|                3         5                       |
|o1 : Matrix RR    <-- RR                          |
|              53        53                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : A == realPartMatrix A                        |
|                                                  |
|o2 = true                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : B = sub(A, CC)                               |
|                                                  |
|o3 = | .892712 .632944  .89189  .775187 .0741835 ||
|     | .673395 .0258884 .231053 .909047 .808694  ||
|     | .29398  .714827  .461944 .314897 .362835  ||
|                                                  |
|                3         5                       |
|o3 : Matrix CC    <-- CC                          |
|              53        53                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : C = realPartMatrix B                         |
|                                                  |
|o4 = | .892712 .632944  .89189  .775187 .0741835 ||
|     | .673395 .0258884 .231053 .909047 .808694  ||
|     | .29398  .714827  .461944 .314897 .362835  ||
|                                                  |
|                3         5                       |
|o4 : Matrix RR    <-- RR                          |
|              53        53                        |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : clean(1e-10, A - C) == 0                     |
|                                                  |
|o5 = true                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : D = random(QQ^3, QQ^1)                       |
|                                                  |
|o6 = | 7/10 |                                     |
|     | 7/10 |                                     |
|     | 7/3  |                                     |
|                                                  |
|              3       1                           |
|o6 : Matrix QQ  <-- QQ                            |
+--------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : D == realPartMatrix D                        |
|                                                  |
|o7 = true                                         |
+--------------------------------------------------+

If the matrix is over a polynomial ring, but has entries defined over the base
field (e.g., when taking *note coefficients: (Macaulay2Doc)coefficients,), then
it is necessary to *note substitute: (Macaulay2Doc)substitute, into the base
field first:



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : R = CC[x,y]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : f = random(2,R)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|                            2                                                |
|o9 = (.951912 + .752574*ii)x  + (.424521 + .641878*ii)x*y + (.267055 +       |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                  2                                                          |
|     .0430999*ii)y                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o9 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : C = last coefficients f                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o10 = {2} | .951912+.752574ii  |                                             |
|      {2} | .424521+.641878ii  |                                             |
|      {2} | .267055+.0430999ii |                                             |
|                                                                             |
|              3      1                                                       |
|o10 : Matrix R  <-- R                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : realPartMatrix sub(C, coefficientRing R)                               |
|                                                                             |
|o11 = | .951912 |                                                            |
|      | .424521 |                                                            |
|      | .267055 |                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|                 3         1                                                 |
|o11 : Matrix RR    <-- RR                                                    |
|               53        53                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

